automations-promo — inodepi campaign films
Built in code with the Lemo-Opuscar library (styles: Dark Tech Keynote, Living Screencast, Desktop Flythrough).

Picture
- All UI, cards, canvases, voxels and typography are drawn in code. No stock or generated images, no screenshots.
- Builds referenced by name (invoice chasing, dead-lead retrieval, sales-call QA, lead-gen & CRM ops) are inodepi's own. Product names (n8n, OpenAI, HubSpot, Google, Pipedrive, Sheets) appear only as plain text labels; no third-party logos or interface chrome are reproduced.

