Licence texts: keynote/fonts/OFL-inter.txt, keynote/fonts/OFL-jetbrainsmono.txt

Voice
- Kokoro TTS v1.0 (hexgrad/Kokoro-82M, Apache-2.0), voice am_michael, via kokoro-onnx.

Music and sound
- Original score synthesised in numpy (FM mallets, pad, pulse, shaker), 120 BPM, A major pentatonic.
- Foley and ambience synthesised in numpy (click, tick, glass, pop, whoosh, thump), driven by the films' event timelines.
- No sampled libraries are used in the mix (the vcsl fetch failed and was not needed).
